{'symbol': 'MO', 'date': '2022-06-24 12:00:00', 'title': 'PODA COMPLETES MULTIPARTY SALE OF INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY ASSETS FOR US$100.5 MILLION', 'text': 'VANCOUVER, BC , JUNE 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ - PODA HOLDINGS, INC. ("PODA" OR THE "COMPANY") (CSE: PODA) (\u200eFSE: 99L) (OTC: PODAF)\xa0IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT, FURTHER TO ITS NEWS RELEASE DATED MAY 13, 2022, THE COMPANY, TOGETHER WITH RYAN SELBY AND RYAN KARKAIRAN (THE\xa0\u200e\u200e"OWNERS"), HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF\xa0SUBSTANTIALLY ALL OF THE ASSETS AND PROPERTIES \u200eUSED IN THE COMPANY\'S BUSINESS (THE "PURCHASED ASSETS") TO ALTRIA CLIENT SERVICES LLC ("ALCS"), A SUBSIDIARY OF ALTRIA GROUP, INC. (NYSE:MO), FOR A TOTAL PURCHASE PRICE OF US$100.5 MILLION ("PURCHASE PRICE"), SUBJECT TO CERTAIN \u200eADJUSTMENTS AND HOLDBACKS (THE\xa0\u200e\u200e"TRANSACTION"), PURSUANT TO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT DATED MAY 13, 2022 (THE "ASSET PURCHASE AGREEMENT").'}